  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "**Must be at least 25 years of age to rent this property.<br>This property is located in Sandestin® Golf and Beach Resort.*<br><br>“Chat N Chill” at 1905 Baytowne Loop brought to you by Beach Blue Properties.<br>TWO Golf Carts, Near Beach, Swimming Pool, Baytowne Wharf<br><br>Welcome to “Chat N Chill”! Our beautifully appointed Mediterranean-style villa is nestled among the palms in the heart of the resort, just minutes from glistening Gulf waters, private beach access, the neighborhood swimming pool, and the Village of Baytowne Wharf. This inviting coastal retreat features an open-concept layout, a fully equipped kitchen, and a covered back patio with golf course views. With two complimentary golf carts included, getting around the resort is effortless, whether heading to the sugar-white sands, the neighborhood pool, or an evening out at Baytowne Wharf or Grand Boulevard.<br><br>Inside, the home features a bright, open-concept layout with upscale furnishings, thoughtful coastal décor, and a built-in speaker system throughout. The fully stocked kitchen is equipped with all the cookware and dinnerware needed to prepare a gourmet meal and features stainless steel appliances as well as an eat-in bar top. The dining and living areas flow seamlessly from the kitchen, creating a welcoming space for relaxing after a day enjoying the beach or exploring the resort. The spacious living area offers comfortable seating along with a queen sleeper sofa for additional sleeping space.<br><br>Just off the main living area, the covered back patio overlooks the scenic golf course and provides a peaceful outdoor setting for grilling and dining al fresco. This space features a gas grill and a fire pit, making it perfect for winding down in the evenings while enjoying the coastal breeze and views.<br><br>The primary suite, located on the first floor, features a comfortable king bed, a spacious closet, and a private ensuite bathroom with a double vanity and a large walk-in shower. This suite also offers a dedicated remote work station with a built-in desk, creating a convenient place to work or plan the next day’s activities.<br><br>Upstairs, the first guest bedroom offers a cozy queen bed and a private ensuite bathroom with a walk-in shower. The second upstairs bedroom is furnished with two twin beds and features an ensuite bathroom with a tub and shower combination, providing a comfortable and flexible layout for families and friends.<br><br>For your convenience, there is a full-size washer and dryer, and high-speed Wi-Fi is complimentary.<br><br>After a fun-filled day at the beach, take a leisurely stroll or hop in your golf cart and make your way to the Village of Baytowne Wharf, just half a mile from the villa. This vibrant outdoor destination offers a unique experience for all ages, blending shopping, dining, and entertainment in a charming waterfront setting. Shopping and dining are also available at the nearby Grand Boulevard shopping center, an open-air community featuring popular retailers like Anthropologie, Lululemon, and Vineyard Vines, along with a great mix of local boutiques and top-rated restaurants. In addition to this, the resort features tennis courts, four championship golf courses, hiking, fishing, kayaking, boogie boarding, miniature golf, and so much more.And with emerald-green waters and white sand beaches just a short eight-minute golf cart ride away, vacationing is easier than ever before!<br><br>Book your stay at 1905 Baytowne Loop, where you can chat, chill and experience all the resort has to offer!<br><br>*Sandestin® is a registered trademark of Sandestin Investments, LLC and is used for location purposes only.<br><br>CANCELLATION: Reservations that are cancelled more than 30 days prior to the arrival date receive a full refund. Reservations cancelled 14-29 days prior to arrival receive a refund of 50% of the amount paid. Reservations cancelled within 14 days of arrival receive no refund unless the guest purchased travel insurance. Guests are required to complete a rental agreement by electronic signature within 3 days of booking.<br>NOTE: The total reservation cost includes the nightly rate, clean fee, damage waiver, transportation fee (for select properties), processing fee and tax. By requesting a quote for this property, you agree to be added to ou",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
